  "reputation": "Upcoming Lighthouse edition building on the BraTS legacy; expected strong interest from the medical imaging community but not yet released for wide benchmarking.",
  "notes": "Clinical, non‑LLM benchmark with high-quality multi-rater annotations; includes small and post-treatment lesions which make the task challenging. Sensitive medical data (controlled access on release); notable class imbalance and need for volumetric MRI expertise.",
